                                "sense_id": "09351327-4529-3f3c-89cd-d2cfc2df7e47",
                                "text": "Another important meta-ethical theory is known as emotivism or non-cognitivism. Emotivists ... claim that all ethical statements are literally meaningless."
                            }
                        ]
